<title>USA: Umatilla Cty., Ore., won by U.S. Bank of Oregon.</title>
<headline>Umatilla Cty., Ore., won by U.S. Bank of Oregon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Bank of Oregon said it won $13.100 million of Umatilla Cty., Ore., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.45 percent.</p>
</text>
